{"title":"Four Fours/111","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/111&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How to use four <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s to get to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/d/58d1eed7be2e1dcbfd4f7fe86fba2eb7566d8bbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$111$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/111&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/3/62373c1a7d8b4e2ead8556caa2e9173cba6a3475.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{444}{4} = 111}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"96\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/111&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/482b0fba62fc7502e8b9fb930374b8f096a3a940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4! = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f7698a3f9be9c1b3fe122d76f0ab6a65b8ebc627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$!4 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bcc8392c8b2f967d183c86d3707b5703806fb88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma(4) = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/c/90c2067e21da2d728f07486f21fccdbfd3262f27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{4! \\times 4 + !4 + \\Gamma(4) = 111}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"195\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/111&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/6/116cff9488863422db9313b0388805ba975279ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{4} + \\sqrt{!4} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"111\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f7698a3f9be9c1b3fe122d76f0ab6a65b8ebc627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$!4 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/a/48a578519da397fe10b98efaa61cb1c65ca1b243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5! = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"65\" height=\"13\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b939b9fccfa7359aa0041b999cf58eac76a499a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\sqrt{\\sqrt{4 \\times 4}} + \\sqrt{!4})! - !4 = 111}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"237\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/111&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f7698a3f9be9c1b3fe122d76f0ab6a65b8ebc627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$!4 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/6/0b63b610ab445dc49a59f9c5863951aa6ec110fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{!4} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"21\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/b/9ab5a5d77ecc123c15993cb82711b7e3b9521d95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{!4 \\times (!4 + \\sqrt{!4}) + \\sqrt{!4} = 111}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"232\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018084846\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 78/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2651/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37252:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018084846 and revision id 287592. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}